<title>UK: TT Group lifts pretax 19.2pct to new record.</title>
<headline>TT Group lifts pretax 19.2pct to new record.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		22.7		   vs 19.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.79		   vs 4.08</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.59		   vs 6.52</p>
<p> Pretax		     53.5		   vs 44.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   520.4		  vs 479.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The UK electronics, industrial and packaging group TT Group Plc said it was in a strong position to continue its growth and looked forward to further expansion this year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
